{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to defeat enemies by building your own path? In Evolit, we combine the classic Tower Defense style with Roguelike elements. Use a variety of cards to build strategic decks and defend against enemies that are as cute as they are dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute but Dangerous Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are countless enemies with incredibly adorable appearances. But don\u2019t be deceived by their looks, they\u2019re extremely dangerous! Some enemies have ranks, and their colors change as they grow stronger. Just another reason to call them cute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/9374b781642e00b25d4f5f08907c379c.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/9374b781642e00b25d4f5f08907c379c.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/9374b781642e00b25d4f5f08907c379c.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many towers with unique mechanics and fun designs. When positioned correctly, they provide the best defense. To upgrade them, you\u2019ll need to collect a few. Crazy Professor, Giant Furball, Training Dummy, Flame and Water Wizards, Vine Man, and an Alien with eight weapons are just some examples. It even includes a tentacle arm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path and Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build decks with diverse gameplay and strategies. Extend paths however you like using road cards and place towers strategically. You can design paths based on your towers\u2019 attack styles. Remember, the longer the path, the more opportunities you\u2019ll have to strike the enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All these elements come together to create a fun, beautiful, and action-packed chaos. Battling these endless waves of enemy invasions won\u2019t be easy. A solid strategy is essential\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/bf0ff3ccc31c02a4667934e7568f38b9.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/bf0ff3ccc31c02a4667934e7568f38b9.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/bf0ff3ccc31c02a4667934e7568f38b9.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/1059d1b229cb429388216b3447e2e7dfb3b1f73c.jpg"},{"name":"Keeping up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/741fbc7abd84bef1fccc40b6245203ee013fa6b8.jpg"},{"name":"Cramped build","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/e800551881973e67a01e696bd8f2479991f5e4b1.jpg"},{"name":"Economist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/fbba2e40eb83df15c9d2a598188fcf46b6069d3e.jpg"},{"name":"Lizard tongue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/dc7722ae4f7284a9e92408e747855b3701ae3cf0.jpg"},{"name":"Undisputable Cleaning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/627006ae5dc4975cbfeb110268898ddd0d10a6c2.jpg"},{"name":"Slow and slower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/772e2e4a307c0ccf5c119420552eee3ffca680bf.jpg"},{"name":"Bigger guns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/99630d5a54fdcdc8595bbbd7a3e90b67a1e056f4.jpg"},{"name":"Thorns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/bc5d55ba367bf1ddf8cb0c7d7d9e7f7974e3a3ed.jpg"},{"name":"41 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2547320/043acba9df8b4b86ac4fee3d9f89c6b1c603b408.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2547320?t=1768831564","background_raw":"https:/