n designs. When positioned correctly, they provide the best defense. To upgrade them, you\u2019ll need to collect a few. Crazy Professor, Giant Furball, Training Dummy, Flame and Water Wizards, Vine Man, and an Alien with eight weapons are just some examples. It even includes a tentacle arm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/d34f9d9a8156e73f9a21747088a8ae3b.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path and Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build decks with diverse gameplay and strategies. Extend paths however you like using road cards and place towers strategically. You can design paths based on your towers\u2019 attack styles. Remember, the longer the path, the more opportunities you\u2019ll have to strike the enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.poster.avif?t=1768831564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.webm?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547320/extras/88fd04e6fbfac88cf9970ac727d5e057.mp4?t=1768831564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >